    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF ObjectFound? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF ObjectGrabbed? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO ObjectTask\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO MoveToNextLocation\n\tEND\n"
